# Freeze: Esc does not interrupt a pending Caps Lock tap.
0 in key KEY_CAPSLOCK down
0 out key KEY_LEFTCTRL down
100 in key KEY_ESC down
100 out key KEY_CAPSLOCK down
120 in key KEY_ESC up
120 out key KEY_CAPSLOCK up
200 in key KEY_CAPSLOCK up
200 out key KEY_LEFTCTRL up
200 out key KEY_ESC down
200 out key KEY_ESC up
